.claude/worktrees/
# RALPH per-worktree orchestration scratch (session state, not repo content).
# Untracked-but-not-ignored kept getting swept into `git add -A` by agents.
.claude/handoff.yaml
# Playwright-MCP screenshot scratch — regenerable captures from browser QA runs,
# never repo content. Same failure mode as handoff.yaml above: 15 of these were
# swept into f0cf3bf (a one-line comment fix) by `git add -A` before this rule
# existed, and /post-merge-cleanup deletes the directory on the documented
# assumption that it is ignored.
.playwright-mcp/

